
  This has **bold text**, *italic     
  text*, *both at once*,              
  ~~strikethrough~~ and inline code in
  one paragraph.                      
                                      
  A **bold with **code** inside** and 
  *italic with **bold** inside* here. 
                                      
  Text with **underscored bold** and  
  *underscored italic* too, and a     
  longer sentence that must wrap      
  nicely around the configured width. 

